        <p>From an initial enquiry to an independent psychiatric expert report, the process begins with understanding the case and agreeing what is needed.</p>
        <a class="home-guidance-button" href="mailto:instructions@insightmedicolegal.co.uk?subject=Expert%20report%20enquiry">Ask about a report <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
