          <h3>Psychiatric assessment</h3>
          <p>The assessment is arranged in person in Glasgow, at an agreed venue elsewhere in Scotland, or by secure video link where clinically appropriate.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-guidance-step">
          <h3>Report and follow-up</h3>
          <p>Reports are typically provided within two to four weeks of assessment. Urgent instructions can be considered. Supplementary or joint reports, and attendance at proof, are available where required.</p>
